cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it through its concept DOI and cite the paper it reproduces."
title: "Two-Regime Operating Laws for Optimal Speed in Delayed and Quantized Pursuit Control — Reproduction Package"
abstract: "Code, stored simulation results and the reference engine for the study of the interior tracking-error optimum of delayed look-ahead pursuit control, its two plant-class constants, and the periodic-orbit structure of the quantized loop."
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
